      "message": "Can we add (or do we already have) a test that exercises that the sk_FragCoord builtin gets synthesized correctly in a fragment shader that references the `sk_FragCoord` variable by name?\n\nIIRC I wanted to make the codegen work in a way that all pipeline inputs that are reachable and has a declaration in the SkSL program would get a field synthesized in the stage input struct without special-casing them (so the built-ins in sksl_frag.sksl would automatically get declarations) but I\u0027m not sure that was tested for sk_FragCoord.",
